# Semantic Segmentation using YOLOv8

This project implements object detection and semantic segmentation using YOLOv8.

## Features
- Object Detection
- Semantic Segmentation
- Video Processing
- Performance Metrics
- Final Video Generation

## Tech Stack
- Python
- Ultralytics YOLOv8
- OpenCV
- MoviePy

## Run

Install:

pip install -r requirements.txt

Train:

python train.py

Predict:

python predict_video.py

Outputs are saved inside:

runs/
